@title Tactics Ogre - The Knight of Lodis (USA)
@file Tactics Ogre - The Knight of Lodis (U) [!].gba
@game ATOE
@chip FLASH
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: nothing is written to flash before the first (tutorial) battle, which has to be won before the first save prompt; it cannot be frozen because the three emulators run different random numbers in it (the rain differs from BATTLE START on, and after Rictor's line the AI turns differ on all three), so the same inputs play a different battle on each

# Opening skipped by START > name "AA" > default birthday > tarot questions
# and the prologue by A every 30 frames > BATTLE START.
# Finding (first_turns, f21505, one A press after Rictor's "Don't worry about
# them all. Just defeat the leader!"): mgba shows the blond ally done (END)
# next to the green soldier, nba shows him far to the right, dingbat-bios is
# on another unit's turn; the rain particles already differ at battle_start
# (f20939), and mgba's BATTLE START banner is on a different fade step.

[new]
wait 1200
# mash A until text sound timeout=2400 every=30  [taps dingbat-bios:39 mgba:39 nba:39]
tap A times=39 every=30 hold=4
press START
# until text 'Enter name' timeout=600 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+70 mgba+70 nba+70]
wait 74
wait 30
checkpoint enter_name window=0
press A after=20
# until text 'Select letter' timeout=300 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+0 mgba+0 nba+0]
wait 4
press A after=30
press A after=20
press A after=20
press START
# until text 'OK?' timeout=300 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+10 mgba+10 nba+5]
wait 14
wait 20
checkpoint name_ok window=0
press A
# until text birthdate timeout=300 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+15 mgba+15 nba+15]
wait 19
wait 30
checkpoint birthday window=0
press A
# until text Yes timeout=300 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+0 mgba+0 nba+0]
wait 4
wait 20
press A
# mash A until text 'BATTLE START' timeout=20000 every=30  [taps dingbat-bios:603 mgba:602 nba:603]
tap A times=603 every=30 hold=4
checkpoint battle_start window=0 compare=none
wait 120
wait 200
checkpoint rictor window=0
press A after=60
wait 300
checkpoint first_turns window=0 compare=none

